From c14c259511f112b7b393da6e24d2af69d2bc5b39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: grinkodbogdan <grinkod.bogdan@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 17:40:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] UI/QRT: the browser window in the QRT shell

A QRT window with a toolbar (back, forward, reload or stop, the on-screen
keyboard, the address) over the page.  Frames from WebContent are copied
into the window; touch drags scroll the page, taps click, the mouse and
keys go to the page or to the address being edited.  The shell's events
wake Ladybird's event loop through qrt_event_fd().
